<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/seo-head', {
    title: 'Landing Page Components | Auto Galleria',
    description: 'The reg-lookup and lead-capture landing page template used for every "Sell your [make] [model]" page — built for conversion and SEO.'
  }) %>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tailwind.css" />
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800">

  <%- include('partials/navbar-brochure') %>

  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-br from-slate-900 via-blue-900 to-slate-800"></div>
    <div class="absolute -top-24 -left-16 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-blue-500/30 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-24 right-0 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-cyan-400/20 blur-3xl"></div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pt-28 pb-16 text-white sm:px-6 sm:pt-32 sm:pb-20 lg:px-8">
      <p class="section-eyebrow text-blue-200">Website components</p>
      <h1 class="max-w-3xl text-4xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-5xl">A landing page built to convert.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-slate-200">Every "Sell your [make] [model]" page runs on the same template: identify the car first, then ask for contact details — so the enquiry feels specific, not generic. One template, generated per model.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 md:py-16 lg:px-8">

    <div class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-3xl text-center">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">One flow, three screens</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">A DVLA reg lookup identifies the exact vehicle before we ask for anything else — the visitor sees their own car before they're asked to hand over details.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">

      <div class="card card-hover flex flex-col">
        <div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-linear-to-br from-slate-800 via-slate-900 to-black p-7">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
          <div class="relative">
            <p class="text-center text-xl font-bold leading-tight text-white drop-shadow-lg">Sell Your <span class="text-cyan-400">Porsche 911</span></p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-slate-300">Enter your registration number</p>
            <div class="relative mt-5">
              <div class="w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-white/30 bg-white/10 px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-white backdrop-blur">AB12 ABC</div>
              <div class="absolute right-1.5 top-1/2 flex h-8 w-8 -translate-y-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-linear-to-br from-blue-500 to-cyan-500 text-sm text-white">&rarr;</div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-center text-[11px] text-slate-400">Secure lookup &middot; no data stored or shared</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-2.5 p-5">
          <span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-blue-700">Step 1</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Reg lookup</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">One field. A DVLA lookup fills in year, colour and fuel type automatically, so the visitor confirms rather than types.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card card-hover flex flex-col">
        <div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-linear-to-br from-slate-800 via-slate-900 to-black p-7">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
          <div class="relative space-y-2.5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-xl border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-3.5 py-2.5 backdrop-blur">
              <div class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/40 bg-emerald-500/30">
                <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-emerald-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="min-w-0">
                <p class="truncate text-xs font-semibold text-white">2019 Porsche 911 Carrera</p>
                <p class="font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-400">AB12 ABC &middot; Grey</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border-2 border-white/30 bg-white/10 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate-400 backdrop-blur">Jane Smith</div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border-2 border-white/30 bg-white/10 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate-400 backdrop-blur">jane@example.com</div>
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-linear-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 py-2.5 text-center text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg">Submit Enquiry</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-2.5 p-5">
          <span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-blue-700">Step 2</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Your details</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">The vehicle found in step one stays pinned above the form, so the visitor sees exactly what they're enquiring about.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card card-hover flex flex-col">
        <div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-linear-to-br from-slate-800 via-slate-900 to-black p-7 text-center">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
          <div class="relative">
            <div class="mx-auto flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-linear-to-br from-emerald-500 to-teal-400 shadow-xl">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-lg font-bold text-white">Enquiry Sent!</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-300">We'll be in touch with an offer shortly</p>
            <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-white/20 bg-white/10 p-3.5 text-left backdrop-blur">
              <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400">Enquiry summary</p>
              <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-white">Jane Smith</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">jane@example.com</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-2.5 p-5">
          <span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-blue-700">Step 3</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Confirmation</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">A summary of what was submitted, with the vehicle and contact details together — no dead end, no uncertainty.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto mb-10 mt-16 max-w-3xl text-center">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">Built to rank, not just convert</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">What's included on every page</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">Beyond the lookup flow, each page carries model-specific content so it stands on its own for search, not just for paid traffic.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 bg-white p-6 transition hover:shadow-lg">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"></path>
            <path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-semibold text-slate-900">Buyer's guide</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Model-specific copy on value factors and selling tips, written for that exact car.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-100 bg-white p-6 transition hover:shadow-lg">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="12" cy="8" r="5"></circle>
            <path d="M8.5 12.5 6 21l6-3 6 3-2.5-8.5"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-semibold text-slate-900">Why-choose-us benefits</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Quick quotes, top offers and free pickup — the same trust signals on every model page.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100 bg-white p-6 transition hover:shadow-lg">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 17.5v.5"></path>
            <path d="M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 3.5 2.3c-.9.4-1.5 1-1.5 2.2"></path>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-semibold text-slate-900">FAQ, with schema</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">An accordion answering the real questions, marked up as FAQPage schema for search snippets.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-rose-100 bg-white p-6 transition hover:shadow-lg">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-rose-200 bg-rose-50 text-rose-700">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="3" y="7" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"></rect>
            <rect x="14" y="7" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"></rect>
            <path d="M10 10.5h4"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-semibold text-slate-900">Related models</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Cross-links to other model pages, keeping visitors on-site and search engines crawling deeper.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 text-center shadow-sm sm:p-10">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">Ready when you are</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">Want a landing page built for one of your models?</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-slate-600">We'll set up the reg lookup, the lead flow, and the supporting content for your make and model.</p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Start a conversation</a>
        <% if (exampleSlug) { %>
          <a href="/sell-your-<%= exampleSlug %>" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-700 transition hover:bg-slate-50">See a live example</a>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>

  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer-brochure') %>

</body>
</html>
